Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='proposalpriced', at=datetime(2026, 10, 4, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title='A proposal is priced by the todo it serves, through the chain set', body="A PROPOSAL IS PRICED BY THE TODO IT SERVES (2026-10-04, the Prodrome's SPEC law 41): the inbox's `Price` is `RefIn(<chain>, <todo>)` for what `serves` names, its own spec only where it serves none, linked through the todo chains read as ONE set of prodromes (`chain_set::ChainSet`, each chain under its own policy, named by its chain), and every row is priced through the same set (`ChainSet::entries`), so a proposal reads its todo's row at every instant, whatever that todo's term refers to; a chain the set does not hold reads `∅`, and a member that does not read is held as that failure, moving nothing that does not refer into it (`app/core/tests/inbox_prices.rs`).", rationale="Decided 2026-10-04 (the Prodrome's SPEC law 41).", supersedes=()))